#| msgid "Let's try to continue to build our intuition for the quantum Fourier transform by making a state in the computational basis, then seeing what happens when we apply the QFT to it. For now, we'll just treat the QFT as a black box that we apply using the `QFTGate` from the [Qiskit circuit library.](/guides/circuit-library) Later, we'll take a peak under the hood to see how it's implemented.\n"
msgid "Let's try to continue to build our intuition for the quantum Fourier transform by making a state in the computational basis, then seeing what happens when we apply the QFT to it. For now, we'll just treat the QFT as a black box that we apply using the `QFTGate` from the [Qiskit circuit library](/guides/circuit-library). Later, we'll delve into the details of its implementation.\n"
