# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use matrix multiplication to verify that the steps in the QFT algorithm indeed result in the $\\text{QFT}_4$ matrix:\n"
msgstr "행렬 곱셈을 이용하여 QFT 알고리즘의 단계들이 실제로 $\\text{QFT}_4$ 행렬을 만들어냄을 검증하세요:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{QFT}_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"    1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & i & -1 & -i \\\\\n"
"    1 & -1 & 1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"    1 & -i & -1 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

